# Fear of Surveillance: "Whenever this creature attacks, surveil 1." It attacks on turn 3; with the trigger on the stack Bot2 Bolts
# it. The ability exists independently of its source (CR 113.7a) and surveil 1 is done by its controller, not by the creature, so it
# still resolves: Bot1 looks at the top card, Lightning Bolt, and puts it into its graveyard (CR 701.25a). No combat damage is dealt.

